TASK DATA
---------

The benchmark data is not redistributed in this repository; `scripts/fetch_*.py` download
it from its upstream sources at pinned revisions. The one exception is RNAGym's
`reference_sheet_final.csv` (MIT, RNAGym team), committed under
src/glmbench/tasks/data/rnagym/. Each data directory has a NOTICE with its source, licence
and citation:

    Gene essentiality   BacBench (Wiatrak et al.), Hugging Face dataset
                        macwiatrak/bacbench-essential-genes-dna (Apache-2.0); labels from the
                        Database of Essential Genes (DEG).
    EC classification   DGEB (West-Roberts et al.), Hugging Face dataset
                        tattabio/ec_classification_dna (Apache-2.0); sequences from UniProt
                        (CC BY 4.0).
    RNAGym DMS          RNAGym (Notin et al.), github.com/MarksLab-DasLab/RNAGym and Hugging
                        Face Marks-lab/RNAgym (MIT).


MODELS
------

No model weights are distributed with this repository. The model specs under specs/ point
at weights published by their authors, under their own licences: LOAM (Soilytix/LOAM-*),
Evo 2, Evo 1.5, gLM2, GenomeOcean, ProkBERT and Nucleotide Transformer v3.
